                <h4 style={{ fontSize: '14px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#F7F8FC', marginBottom: '12px', margin: '0 0 12px 0' }}>
                  Match Analysis & Predictions
                </h4>
                <div style={{ fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '1.7', color: '#A8B0C0' }}>
                  <p style={{ margin: '0 0 12px 0' }}>
                    <strong style={{ color: '#D4AF37' }}>Liverpool (68% Win Probability)</strong> - The Reds enter this fixture in exceptional form with 65% win rate over their last 5 matches. Playing at home provides additional advantage. They've averaged 2.3 goals per match and currently sit 2nd in the league with 12 points.
